   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Article 312 – new All India Service:** Parliament can create a new All India Service if the **Rajya Sabha** passes a resolution supported by **two-thirds** of members present and voting."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 94,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Financial liberalisation:** in the Washington Consensus, **market-determined interest rates** are the financial-liberalisation prescription; a **competitive exchange rate** is a separate exchange-rate prescription."
  }
 ],
